{"3706510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rise of Adou", "steam_appid": 3706510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise of Adou</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Multi-Ending Character-Raising Game</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rise of Adou</i> is a multi-ending raising simulation game. You will personally guide and nurture Adou, interact with legendary generals of Shu Han, fight alongside new companions, and lead him toward different fates—rewriting the ending of Shu Han itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/763834c8da9dee2f710cc0fc8af4a5e9.avif?t=1750422748\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras_big/763834c8da9dee2f710cc0fc8af4a5e9.avif?t=1750422748 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studying boosts many of Adou’s attributes, but it also increases stress and darkness. Will you push him hard for excellence, or give him a joyful, carefree childhood? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two main types of endings: <strong>Career Endings</strong> and <strong>Romantic Endings</strong>. Based on Adou’s final attributes, you can unlock different career paths—even the chance to unify the Three Kingdoms. Meanwhile, five characters are romanceable, each offering a unique romantic conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/c31a3e1991d8273011c7c179a80a0aac.avif?t=1750422748\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras_big/c31a3e1991d8273011c7c179a80a0aac.avif?t=1750422748 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/7538b09e4dd922121dbd597b94346f4c.avif?t=1750422748\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras_big/7538b09e4dd922121dbd597b94346f4c.avif?t=1750422748 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple growth paths and a wide variety of <strong>mini-games</strong>, including puzzles, log striking, card matching, trivia quizzes, archery, guqin playing, arithmetic, and more. Each mini-game enhances different stats. Help Adou grow through every challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/3aecbd3807e258f1d6950f2dbd81236d.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in classic <strong>turn-based combat</strong> and grow together with your companions. Each character has a unique combat style. With a six-person team, you can form countless formations—adapt to different enemies with smart tactics to unleash powerful effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/d5980c3e432e98df9cac52363015cbe7.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your companions, build bonds over time, and grow alongside them. These relationships will become Adou’s strength on the road ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/bc12531fa511db67257526dc170d1e7e.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rise of Adou</i> is the developer’s first game, born from both a sense of regret and imagination about the fall of Shu Han. While making this game, the developer studied history, learned tools, and slowly “raised” Adou. Though the journey wasn’t easy, it was deeply meaningful. We hope this game brings you joy—even if just for a brief, memorable moment.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise of Adou</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Multi-Ending Character-Raising Game</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rise of Adou</i> is a multi-ending raising simulation game. You will personally guide and nurture Adou, interact with legendary generals of Shu Han, fight alongside new companions, and lead him toward different fates—rewriting the ending of Shu Han itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/763834c8da9dee2f710cc0fc8af4a5e9.avif?t=1750422748\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras_big/763834c8da9dee2f710cc0fc8af4a5e9.avif?t=1750422748 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studying boosts many of Adou’s attributes, but it also increases stress and darkness. Will you push him hard for excellence, or give him a joyful, carefree childhood? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two main types of endings: <strong>Career Endings</strong> and <strong>Romantic Endings</strong>. Based on Adou’s final attributes, you can unlock different career paths—even the chance to unify the Three Kingdoms. Meanwhile, five characters are romanceable, each offering a unique romantic conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/c31a3e1991d8273011c7c179a80a0aac.avif?t=1750422748\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras_big/c31a3e1991d8273011c7c179a80a0aac.avif?t=1750422748 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/7538b09e4dd922121dbd597b94346f4c.avif?t=1750422748\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras_big/7538b09e4dd922121dbd597b94346f4c.avif?t=1750422748 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple growth paths and a wide variety of <strong>mini-games</strong>, including puzzles, log striking, card matching, trivia quizzes, archery, guqin playing, arithmetic, and more. Each mini-game enhances different stats. Help Adou grow through every challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/3aecbd3807e258f1d6950f2dbd81236d.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in classic <strong>turn-based combat</strong> and grow together with your companions. Each character has a unique combat style. With a six-person team, you can form countless formations—adapt to different enemies with smart tactics to unleash powerful effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/d5980c3e432e98df9cac52363015cbe7.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your companions, build bonds over time, and grow alongside them. These relationships will become Adou’s strength on the road ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/extras/bc12531fa511db67257526dc170d1e7e.avif?t=1750422748\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rise of Adou</i> is the developer’s first game, born from both a sense of regret and imagination about the fall of Shu Han. While making this game, the developer studied history, learned tools, and slowly “raised” Adou. Though the journey wasn’t easy, it was deeply meaningful. We hope this game brings you joy—even if just for a brief, memorable moment.</p>", "short_description": "&quot;Rise of A'dou&quot; is a multi-ending life simulation game. Rewrite history by raising A'dou into a true ruler. Rally companions, forge bonds, and create a new future for Shu Han in an unforgettable era of the Three Kingdoms.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/fb5bf0ac2283982ab7ab407cb5b8d5c891963075/header.jpg?t=1750422748", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/ed0c5b5b61cf84abdd6875e557f52de6880f0f3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750422748", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706510/ed0c5b5b61cf84abdd6875e557f52de6880f0f3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750422748", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 或同等性能处理器<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 支持 OpenGL 3.3 或以上的显卡<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 无特殊要求<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 鼠标操作体验更佳，不支持触屏设备</li></ul>", "recommended": "<stro